Once the script has succeeded on the host, a snapshot is taken just before the
registry changes (so also for
.BR "host move" ),
holding the registry, the host records,
.I staging
and the UID ledger
.RB ( "backup restore"
puts them back); if it cannot be taken the registry is left as it was and the
command says so.
