A host with no pinned host key gets the keys it offers pinned, as at
enrollment. A pin is never changed by a sync: a key that differs from the
pinned one is reported, with the pinned and offered fingerprints, and new key
types are reported; both are fixed with
.BI "device hostkey " name " accept" \fR.
.IP
A host with a break\-glass hold
