.BR "group list" ", " "group show" ", " "scope list" ", " "backend list" ", " "backend status" ", "
.BR "device list" ", " "device show" ", " "device notice list" ", " "device client\-config" ", "
.BR "ssh " \fIname\fR " and " "device ssh " \fIname\fR
(the devices of their own scopes only), and the console's own
.BR _console\-policy .
