.RB ( "host enroll" ", " sync ", " move ", " target ", " provisioner ", " rename ", " forget ", " unenroll
and
.BR default\-method ):
an engineer changes no setting that makes a host sync necessary, and a host is
not found to the device verbs,
.BR "device hostkey" ,
and
.BR \-\-staging .
