.TP
\fB\-\-force\fR
Drop content the store cannot represent (each item is listed).
.TP
\fB\-\-replace\fR
Overwrite an existing store.
.RE
.\" END GENERATED: command store import
.TP
.B store rollback
Restore the pre-store
