.SS Per-scope default authentication method \fB(tacctl scope auth-method)\fR
.TP
.BI "scope auth-method " scope " [" tacacs | radius | clear ]
Show or set the protocol this scope uses when a command names none:
.BR "config cisco" ,
.B "config juniper"
and
.B "config wti"
without
.BR --protocol ,
.B "host enroll"
(for a host that is not registered yet) and
.B "config linux script"
without
.B --method
.RB ( tacacs
is host method
.BR tacplus ).
The order is: an explicit
.B --protocol
or
.BR --method ;
a registered host's own method; this setting; the one protocol the
scope's
.B protocols
filter names, when it names exactly one; the global default (device
configurations TACACS+, hosts
.BR "host default-method" ).
.B clear
removes the setting
.RB ( default
is accepted for it);
.B tacplus
is accepted for
.BR tacacs ,
which is the one spelling it prints.
Refused when the scope's
.B protocols
filter leaves the protocol out;
.B "scope protocols"
in turn refuses a list without the scope's auth-method.
